        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-815, Solid Brass Traditional Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBeautiful in its classic design, the Solid Brass Traditional Cabinet Pull features decorative ends that add a lovely detail to an already lovely cabinet pull. This Plain Pull with Decorative Ends is available in both a 3 inch center length, a 5 inch center to center length, and an 8 inch center to center length. Choose from the 7 available finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/urn-tip-door-handle-rk-international-ph-4622\"><b>Plain Door Pull with Decorative Ends</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-815 Rod with Button End Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-815</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-816</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 6-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-817</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 9-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR50_size.gif?v=1704354712\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
